        "intro_highlight": "The Multiderm (5 in 1) workstation consolidates vital treatment modalities into a single, high-efficiency system engineered specifically to minimize practitioner operational footprints while upholding rigorous North American manufacturing standards.",
        "custom_description": "<p>Multiderm (5 in 1) is purpose-built for licensed professionals, including Estheticians, Clinical Spa Therapists, and Clinical Spa Technicians. Its precision-engineered chassis targets shoulder fatigue during high-volume clinic days, enabling sharper focus on treatment execution and enhanced client comfort. Whether you are performing deep-pore cleansing, microdermabrasion, or post-procedure recovery, this professional station adjusts to your modality-specific positioning with intuitive one-hand control and instant-response calibration.</p>",
        "subtitle": "Advanced Quintuple Modality Integration System",
        "secondary_description": "<p>Uncompromising durability is central to the Equipro approach. To preserve the structural integrity and aesthetic finish of the Multiderm (5 in 1), regular sanitization with hospital-grade surface disinfectants formulated for clinical environments must be executed daily. The heavy-duty exterior casing offers high chemical resistance, ensuring an immaculate condition outcome across an extended multi-year operational timeframe. Consistent care preserves electrical connectivity, guards against fluid ingress, and guarantees long-term mechanical reliability.</p>",
