          "settings": {
            "question": "Clinical Esthetician:",
            "answer": "<p>For the Clinical Esthetician executing advanced corrective facials, the integrated high-frequency module delivers localized thermal energy to the epidermal layers, significantly accelerating cellular turnover and purifying congested pores. This specialized modality stabilizes the skin's electrical potential immediately following intensive extraction cycles, ensuring rapid vasoconstriction and a dramatic reduction in transient redness before the client departs the treatment room.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_74hYTC": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Clinical Spa Technician:",
            "answer": "<p>For the Clinical Spa Therapist managing multi-step clinical optimization protocols, the high-performance vacuum and spray systems provide seamless sebum extraction and micro-targeted nutrient misting. By coupling adjustable mechanical suction with ultra-fine atomization, the practitioner can effortlessly lift deep impurities without causing vascular distension, immediately priming the skin barrier for maximum absorption of high-potency topical serums.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_bhzmwM": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Cosmetic Injector or Pre-Post Operative Skin Specialist:",
            "answer": "<p>For the Cosmetic Injector or Pre-Post Operative Skin Specialist, the galvanic current functionality offers precise iontophoresis and desincrustation capabilities. This advanced electronic modulation controls polarity to deeply infuse water-soluble compounds into the dermal matrices or emulsify hardened follicular blockages, creating an optimized, deeply hydrated tissue environment that complements advanced clinical procedures.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
